  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;be a circle passing through <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and touching the parabola <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>. Then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi></math>&nbsp;is equal to _____"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>16</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>88</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>72</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "A"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"assets\\st0060_1014b82f5759.png\" style=\"width: 208px; height: 140px;\" /></p><p>Equation of tangent at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;to the parabola <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Then family of circle touching this tangent at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>Since it passes through <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>, we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>So, equation&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mfenced></math> becomes <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>44</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>84</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Hence,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>80</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn></math></p>"
  }
}